            "answer": "<p>åKrrush PRO delivers 20g of hydrolyzed protein plus electrolytes in a single stick — more than 1.5x the protein of standard bone broth. Every batch is third-party tested for heavy metals, contaminants, and microbial safety. We use enzymatic hydrolysis, a cold-process that breaks collagen into small peptides your body absorbs 1.5x faster than traditionally boiled broth.</p>"
